    fields:  # f54e
      statement: "Every file path has exactly one file-kind Symbol across all producers (analyzers and linkers). The js_module linker violates this on 5 .ts paths on hypergumbo self-analysis (origins={'javascript-v1', 'js-module-linker-v1'}), generalizing the INV-ronuf shape from websocket to js_module."  # f54e
      root_cause: "js_module linker constructs file Symbol ids embedding absolute paths from Path objects yielded by its file-walk helper, while the JavaScript analyzer + orchestrator file-symbol synthesizer emit canonical ids with repo-relative paths (normalized in analyze/all_analyzers.py before linkers run). Canonical-shape dedup misses the cross-producer collision; both Symbols persist; the post-linker path normalization at cli.py:7244-7247 fixes Symbol.path but not Symbol.id."  # f54e
- op: discuss  # 3b81
